  sampleClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e412646740190924c9721c615d71f3e0, type: 3}
  sampleWavPath: 
  language: en
  sampleTranscript: You know, I've watched empires rise and crumble into dust. I've
    seen stars burn out that people still wish upon. I've buried lovers and forgotten
    more names than most will ever learn. And yet, of all those centuries, you're
    the first reason I've wanted to stay past dawn.
